# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 9 (a host's supplier answers each child place; a forwarded element is re-emitted at its row's 0 and answered by the World in the tick it delivers): `@named` is ts-ch05-supplier-rank2's inline supplier named, so its transcript is that test's; `@Forward` forwards every place, so the host is observably not there but for the deeper paths.
